      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CONTINUOUS - score_weighted, and this is the part worth reading twice.  conditional_on narrows the epoch set to those whose categorical\nvalue EQUALS the winner, so depth_1 is the band depth OF THE MINERAL THAT WON - weighted toward its barest looks, because a vegetated look's\ndepth is diluted by the canopy. spread: iqr ships the disagreement.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CONTINUOUS - score_weighted, and this is the part worth reading twice.  conditional_on narrows the epoch set to those whose categorical\nvalue EQUALS the winner, so depth_1 is the band depth OF THE MINERAL THAT WON - weighted toward its barest looks, because a vegetated look's\ndepth is diluted by the canopy. spread: iqr ships the disagreement.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
